 result←object value arg;new;low;high;old
 old←object ##.##.∆WG'Thumb'
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←old
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: value'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt new←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: value'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴new
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: value'##.##.Error 1≠≢new
     (low high)←object ⎕VGET⊂'_range'(0 100)
     object._increment←new←⊃low⌈high⌊new
     object ##.##.∆WS'Thumb'new
     :If old≠new ⍝ Has the Thumb position changed?
         'Change?'##.##.Event object ##.##.Application,arg[1] ⍝ Invoke their onChange handler internally
     :EndIf
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
